			"notes": "Features: \n- Tweak difficulty of trades\n- Add recipes for mixing paint\n- Added \"poor blueprints\" that can be used to cheaply (but tediously) duplicate blueprints\n- Made blueprint combinations more fruitful\n- Tweaked flight agility to make stats more relevant\n- Adjusted villager trades to be more appropriate for their levels\n- Fixed bug where glider was achieving lift\n- Added \"flipped\" recipes for a lot of things\n- Made shift-clicking \"smart\" in ref table and sanding machine\n- Added \"blueprint folder\" item (allows blueprints to \"stack\" in inventory)\n\nBug Fixes:\n- \"Noisy tech item\" sound should only play if tech item is part of recipe\n- Advanced blueprints no longer stack\n- Better enforcement of \"glide board should not lift\"\n- Fixed board deployments de-sync with server causing \"failure to launch\"\n\nChores:\n- Cleaned up board deployment code"
